{"id": "de-witze-1lxggiz.en", "jokeId": "de-witze-1lxggiz", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; the walk through town is shown, not narrated. Both girls wear the same colour so the matching leggings read on screen.", "title": "Leggings", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["devushka", "paren", "devushka-blondinka"], "roles": {"devushka": "girlfriend", "paren": "boyfriend", "devushka-blondinka": "woman"}, "looks": {"devushka": {"clothes": "#d97fb0"}, "devushka-blondinka": {"clothes": "#d97fb0"}}, "lines": [{"character": "devushka", "text": "Look, that girl up ahead is wearing the same leggings as me.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "paren", "text": "True, but on yours the flowers are bigger.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1r115am.de", "jokeId": "de-witze-1r115am", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Dialogue kept verbatim, the wife's line split in two; the narrator intro is shown by the picture.", "title": "Drei Tage Schweigen", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["zhena", "muzhik"], "roles": {"zhena": "wife", "muzhik": "husband"}, "lines": [{"character": "zhena", "text": "Ich habe nun seit drei Tagen nicht mehr mit dir gesprochen.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Interessiert es dich denn wirklich gar nicht, warum?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Nein Schatz, ich vertraue dir und respektiere deine Entscheidung.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1r115am.ru", "jokeId": "de-witze-1r115am", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; the wife's line split in two.", "title": "Три дня молчания", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["zhena", "muzhik"], "roles": {"zhena": "wife", "muzhik": "husband"}, "lines": [{"character": "zhena", "text": "Я уже три дня с тобой не разговариваю.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Тебе что, правда совсем не интересно почему?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Нет, дорогая, я тебе доверяю и уважаю твоё решение.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1r115am.en", "jokeId": "de-witze-1r115am", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; the wife's line split in two.", "title": "Three Days of Silence", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["zhena", "muzhik"], "roles": {"zhena": "wife", "muzhik": "husband"}, "lines": [{"character": "zhena", "text": "I haven't spoken to you for three days now.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Are you really not interested in why?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "No, honey, I trust you and respect your decision.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1rddzy8.de", "jokeId": "de-witze-1rddzy8", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Dialogue kept verbatim; the employee wears a tie, the wife is only mentioned.", "title": "Feierabend", "location": "ofis", "cast": ["paren", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "nachalnik": "boss"}, "looks": {"paren": {"add": ["tie"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "paren", "text": "Chef, kann ich heute drei Stunden früher Feierabend machen?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Meine Frau will unbedingt mit mir einkaufen gehen.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Das kommt überhaupt nicht infrage, ich bezahle dich doch nicht für die freie Zeit!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Danke, ich wusste, dass ich mich auf Sie verlassen kann!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1rddzy8.ru", "jokeId": "de-witze-1rddzy8", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; the employee wears a tie.", "title": "Отпроситься", "location": "ofis", "cast": ["paren", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "nachalnik": "boss"}, "looks": {"paren": {"add": ["tie"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "paren", "text": "Шеф, можно я сегодня уйду с работы на три часа раньше?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Жена непременно хочет пойти со мной по магазинам.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Об этом не может быть и речи, я тебе не за свободное время плачу!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Спасибо, я знал, что на вас можно положиться!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1rddzy8.en", "jokeId": "de-witze-1rddzy8", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; the employee wears a tie.", "title": "Leaving Early", "location": "ofis", "cast": ["paren", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "nachalnik": "boss"}, "looks": {"paren": {"add": ["tie"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "paren", "text": "Boss, can I knock off three hours early today?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "My wife absolutely insists on going shopping with me.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "That's completely out of the question, I'm not paying you for time off!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Thank you, I knew I could count on you!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1wvoq61.de", "jokeId": "de-witze-1wvoq61", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "All four visits kept; the hen walks in and out each day, the clerk stays at the counter he threatens to nail her to. Clerk in a red vest.", "title": "Spachtelmasse", "location": "magazin", "cast": ["ptitsa", "barmen"], "roles": {"ptitsa": "chicken", "barmen": "salesman"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein Huhn kommt in den Baumarkt.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "Haben Sie Spachtelmasse?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Nein, tut mir leid.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "exit": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Am nächsten Tag kommt das Huhn wieder.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "Haben Sie Spachtelmasse?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Nein, haben wir nicht!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "exit": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Am dritten Tag kommt das Huhn wieder.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "Haben Sie Spachtelmasse?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Hör mal zu, du Federvieh!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Wenn du mich noch einmal nach Spachtelmasse fragst, dann nagel ich deine Füße am Tresen fest!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "exit": ["ptitsa"], "laugh": "chuckle"}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Am vierten Tag kommt das Huhn wieder.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "Haben Sie Nägel?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Nein, heute nicht.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "Gut... Haben Sie Spachtelmasse?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "magazin", "cast": ["ptitsa", "barmen"], "roles": {"ptitsa": "chicken", "barmen": "salesman"}, "looks": {"barmen": {"clothes": "#c0392b"}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "to": "counter"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}]}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1wvoq61.ru", "jokeId": "de-witze-1wvoq61", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line, all four visits kept; Federvieh → пернатая. The clerk stays at the counter.", "title": "Шпаклёвка", "location": "magazin", "cast": ["ptitsa", "barmen"], "roles": {"ptitsa": "chicken", "barmen": "salesman"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Курица заходит в строительный магазин.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "У вас есть шпаклёвка?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Нет, к сожалению.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "exit": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "На следующий день курица приходит снова.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "У вас есть шпаклёвка?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Нет, у нас её нет!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "exit": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "На третий день курица приходит опять.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "У вас есть шпаклёвка?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Слушай сюда, пернатая!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Если ты ещё раз спросишь у меня шпаклёвку, я прибью твои лапы гвоздями к прилавку!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "exit": ["ptitsa"], "laugh": "chuckle"}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "На четвёртый день курица приходит снова.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "У вас есть гвозди?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Нет, сегодня нет.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "Хорошо... У вас есть шпаклёвка?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "magazin", "cast": ["ptitsa", "barmen"], "roles": {"ptitsa": "chicken", "barmen": "salesman"}, "looks": {"barmen": {"clothes": "#c0392b"}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "to": "counter"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}]}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1wvoq61.en", "jokeId": "de-witze-1wvoq61", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line, all four visits kept; Spachtelmasse → spackle, Federvieh → bag of feathers.", "title": "Spackle", "location": "magazin", "cast": ["ptitsa", "barmen"], "roles": {"ptitsa": "chicken", "barmen": "salesman"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "A chicken walks into a hardware store.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "Do you have any spackle?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "No, sorry.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "exit": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The next day the chicken comes back.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "Do you have any spackle?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "No, we don't!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "exit": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "On the third day the chicken comes back again.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "Do you have any spackle?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Listen here, you bag of feathers!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "If you ask me for spackle one more time, I'll nail your feet to the counter!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "exit": ["ptitsa"], "laugh": "chuckle"}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "On the fourth day the chicken comes back.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "Do you have any nails?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["ptitsa"]}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "No, not today.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "ptitsa", "text": "Good... Do you have any spackle?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "magazin", "cast": ["ptitsa", "barmen"], "roles": {"ptitsa": "chicken", "barmen": "salesman"}, "looks": {"barmen": {"clothes": "#c0392b"}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "to": "counter"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}]}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1rmatg6.de", "jokeId": "de-witze-1rmatg6", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Dialogue verbatim, times written as words, 'sie' corrected to 'Sie'. Commuter with tie and briefcase, farmer at the fence in a straw hat; the bull is only mentioned.", "title": "Abkürzung", "location": "derevnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "farmer"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Darf ich über Ihr Feld laufen?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Das wäre für mich eine Abkürzung und ich bekäme noch die Bahn um siebzehn Uhr zwanzig.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Gerne, wenn mein Stier Sie sieht, bekommen Sie vielleicht sogar noch die Bahn um siebzehn Uhr zehn.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "derevnya", "place": "farm", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "farmer"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["tie"]}, "muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["straw-hat"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "left"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "fence"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "suitcase", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1rmatg6.ru", "jokeId": "de-witze-1rmatg6", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; Bahn → электричка, times as words.", "title": "Короткий путь", "location": "derevnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "farmer"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Можно я пройду через ваше поле?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Так мне короче, и я ещё успею на электричку в семнадцать двадцать.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Пожалуйста, если вас увидит мой бык, может, вы даже успеете на электричку в семнадцать десять.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "derevnya", "place": "farm", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "farmer"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["tie"]}, "muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["straw-hat"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "left"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "fence"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "suitcase", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1rmatg6.en", "jokeId": "de-witze-1rmatg6", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; 17:20 and 17:10 become the five twenty and the five ten.", "title": "The Shortcut", "location": "derevnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "farmer"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "May I cut across your field?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "It's a shortcut for me, and I'd still make the five twenty train.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Sure, if my bull sees you, you might even make the five ten train.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "derevnya", "place": "farm", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "farmer"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["tie"]}, "muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["straw-hat"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "left"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "fence"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "suitcase", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1ps127e.de", "jokeId": "de-witze-1ps127e", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Child's line verbatim, split before the reveal; the title becomes a one-line narrator setup. Mother in an apron stays silent on screen.", "title": "Der Wunschzettel", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["zhena", "vovochka"], "roles": {"zhena": "mother", "vovochka": "child"}, "looks": {"zhena": {"add": ["apron"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Kurz vor Heiligabend.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Mami! Mami! Wo ist mein Wunschzettel an das Christkind?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["vovochka"]}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Ich muss schnell die Eisenbahn streichen,", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.6}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "denn ich habe gerade eine ganz hinten in deinem Kleiderschrank gefunden.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1ps127e.ru", "jokeId": "de-witze-1ps127e", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "reworked", "notes": "Christkind → Ded Moroz per adaptNote, so Christmas Eve becomes New Year; the rest translated line by line.", "title": "Письмо Деду Морозу", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["zhena", "vovochka"], "roles": {"zhena": "mother", "vovochka": "child"}, "looks": {"zhena": {"add": ["apron"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Перед самым Новым годом.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Мама! Мама! Где моё письмо Деду Морозу?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["vovochka"]}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Мне надо срочно вычеркнуть железную дорогу,", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.6}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "потому что я только что нашёл её в самой глубине твоего шкафа.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1ps127e.en", "jokeId": "de-witze-1ps127e", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "reworked", "notes": "Christkind → Santa per adaptNote; wardrobe → closet, Eisenbahn → train set.", "title": "The Wish List", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["zhena", "vovochka"], "roles": {"zhena": "mother", "vovochka": "child"}, "looks": {"zhena": {"add": ["apron"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Right before Christmas.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Mommy! Mommy! Where's my wish list for Santa?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["vovochka"]}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "I have to cross off the train set real quick,", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.6}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "because I just found one at the very back of your closet.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1wv5fd2.de", "jokeId": "de-witze-1wv5fd2", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Narration kept in the source's words; the question to the waiter turned into direct speech. Two evenings as two scenes with a wipe; diners at the next table are a small crowd. Tourist with camera, waiter in a black vest.", "title": "Stierkampf", "location": "bar", "cast": ["muzhik-sosed", "barmen"], "roles": {"muzhik-sosed": "tourist", "barmen": "waiter"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein Tourist besucht ein traditionelles Restaurant direkt neben der Stierkampfarena in Madrid.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Er sieht, wie am Nachbartisch eine Spezialität des Hauses serviert wird: zwei riesige, köstliche Fleischbällchen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Was ist das?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Señor, das sind die Hoden des Stiers, der heute Nachmittag in der Arena gekämpft hat.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Eine absolute Delikatesse!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Der Tourist ist begeistert und bestellt das Gericht für den nächsten Abend vor.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Am folgenden Abend bekommt er seinen Teller serviert, doch darauf liegen zwei winzig kleine Fleischbällchen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Sagen Sie, gestern waren die Fleischbällchen aber dreimal so groß!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Was ist passiert?", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Ay, Señor... Manchmal gewinnt eben auch der Stier.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bar", "cast": ["muzhik-sosed", "barmen"], "roles": {"muzhik-sosed": "tourist", "barmen": "waiter"}, "looks": {"muzhik-sosed": {"add": ["camera"]}, "barmen": {"clothes": "#222222"}}, "crowd": {"who": "guests", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}, {"location": "bar", "transition": "wipe", "cast": ["muzhik-sosed", "barmen"], "roles": {"muzhik-sosed": "tourist", "barmen": "waiter"}, "looks": {"muzhik-sosed": {"add": ["camera"]}, "barmen": {"clothes": "#222222"}}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}]}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1wv5fd2.ru", "jokeId": "de-witze-1wv5fd2", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; Hoden → яйца быка keeps the punch, Fleischbällchen → мясные шарики. Two evenings as two scenes.", "title": "Коррида", "location": "bar", "cast": ["muzhik-sosed", "barmen"], "roles": {"muzhik-sosed": "tourist", "barmen": "waiter"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Турист заходит в традиционный ресторан прямо рядом с ареной для корриды в Мадриде.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Он видит, как за соседним столиком подают фирменное блюдо: два огромных аппетитных мясных шарика.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "А что это такое?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Сеньор, это яйца быка, который сегодня днём сражался на арене.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Настоящий деликатес!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Турист в восторге и заказывает это блюдо на следующий вечер.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "На следующий вечер ему приносят тарелку, но на ней лежат два крошечных шарика.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Послушайте, вчера шарики были в три раза больше!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Что случилось?", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Ай, сеньор... Иногда побеждает и бык.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bar", "cast": ["muzhik-sosed", "barmen"], "roles": {"muzhik-sosed": "tourist", "barmen": "waiter"}, "looks": {"muzhik-sosed": {"add": ["camera"]}, "barmen": {"clothes": "#222222"}}, "crowd": {"who": "guests", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}, {"location": "bar", "transition": "wipe", "cast": ["muzhik-sosed", "barmen"], "roles": {"muzhik-sosed": "tourist", "barmen": "waiter"}, "looks": {"muzhik-sosed": {"add": ["camera"]}, "barmen": {"clothes": "#222222"}}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}]}]}
